flowchart TD
    subgraph Browser ["Client Tier: Next.js + React 19"]
        Workspace["Workspace Shell (ContextDrawer)"]
        SearchUI["Debounced Search Typeahead"]
        ProfileModal["User Profile & Follow Modal"]
        SetupGate["Profile Onboarding Form (/app/profile)"]
    end

    subgraph BFF ["Next.js Server Layer (BFF)"]
        AppGate["AppLayout Gate (!profileComplete redirect)"]
        SearchProxy["Search API Proxy (/api/users/search)"]
        Actions["Server Actions: updateProfile / followUser"]
    end

    subgraph Backend ["Go Modular Monolith (127.0.0.1:8080)"]
        Mux["Chi Mux Engine"]
        SecMW["Security MW (Session, CSRF, Origin, RateLimiter)"]
        ProfSvc["Profile Service (Me, PatchMe, Public)"]
        DiscSvc["Discovery Service (SearchUsers, Typeahead)"]
        RelSvc["Relationship Service (Follow, Unfollow)"]
        Repo["Repository Tier (sqlc + pgxpool)"]
    end

    subgraph DB ["PostgreSQL 17 Database Engine"]
        UsersTab["users (id, username, display_name, bio, avatar_url)"]
        IdentTab["email_identities (email, user_id)"]
        FollowTab["follows (follower_id, following_id, created_at)"]
        TrgmIdx["GIN Trigram Indexes (pg_trgm)"]
    end

    SearchUI -->|Debounced query >= 1 char| SearchProxy
    ProfileModal -->|Follow / Unfollow action| Actions
    SetupGate -->|Submit username & display name| Actions
    Workspace -->|Check session state| AppGate

    SearchProxy -->|GET /v1/users?q=... + Session Cookie| Mux
    Actions -->|PATCH /v1/me or POST /v1/users/{u}/follow| Mux

    Mux --> SecMW
    SecMW --> ProfSvc
    SecMW --> DiscSvc
    SecMW --> RelSvc

    ProfSvc --> Repo
    DiscSvc --> Repo
    RelSvc --> Repo

    Repo --> UsersTab
    Repo --> IdentTab
    Repo --> FollowTab
    Repo --> TrgmIdx
